# Everything here is build-time or development material that the deployed site
# never loads. Left in, Vercel serves it: /supabase/migrations/*.sql was
# publicly readable, which handed anyone the full RLS map and -- worse -- the
# two email addresses in bootstrap_admins that are granted admin on signup,
# i.e. exactly which inboxes to go after.
#
# The site fetches exactly one thing from this tree at runtime,
# uploads/clubs.json, plus assets/ and support.js. Nothing below is on that
# list; verified with a grep for fetch() and for docs/ and supabase/ paths in
# index.html.

supabase/
docs/
multirole/
landing page/
README.md
.thumbnail
